  "name": "Cohesion of the Primal",
  "type": "subclass",
  "img": "modules/grimnir-lyonesse/assets/icons/lorc-quill-ink.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Primal Wizards carve their spells into their own flesh, weaving ink with ancient power older than Grimnir itself. They chase the echoes of this first world; an early, primeval, state of the current world. Some, called Dreamers, seek hidden truths in those echoes, believing the primal past holds the key to saving Grimnir from the fate of the Lost Lands. Others, the Seekers, hunt and destroy artifacts, lost tomes, and any mage reckless enough to pursue such forbidden knowledge.</p>"
    },
